">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">|</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">|</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">|</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">|</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhich means that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"108\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2